{"detail": {"templateUuid": "ce91882273bd443d8b0ecdec4a477226", "projectUuid": "eb57403368504cf0b6d0632482bf2248", "name": "山海拾遗官", "description": "上古有奇书《山海经》，记载天下异兽四百余种。世人皆以为是神话，却不知，千百年来，一直有一个隐秘宗门——山海阁，默默守护着这些仍存在于人间的奇物。\n山海阁的使命，不是降服，而是“拾遗”。找到那些因天地异变或人心蛊惑而失控的异兽，让它们重归正途。\n直到十五年前的一个雨夜，山海阁被冠以“勾结异兽、图谋不轨”的罪名，惨遭灭门。满门三百七十二人，仅剩一个少年，被押入天牢。\n那个少年，就是陆言。", "coverUrl": "/assets/2164e2a99cba42f3.webp", "finalOutput": "https://libtv-res.liblib.art/upload-images/0bfcda928d704e8da3d20977029a31b8/f5497f3a240932345c6b197f9fd60a3dd4c79a17.mp4", "snapshotId": 16282, "auditStatus": 1, "ownerId": 2886492, "ownerUuid": "0bfcda928d704e8da3d20977029a31b8", "avatar": "/assets/8b9c1bea9afdbe38.webp", "nickname": "星燃AI", "isLike": false, "likeCount": 55, "tags": [{"id": 1802, "code": "3d", "tagLabel": "3D", "parentTag": 1800, "categoryId": 0, "path": "1800/1802/", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 2, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 1}, {"id": 3036, "code": "test", "tagLabel": "AI漫剧精卫计划", "parentTag": 0, "categoryId": 0, "path": "3036/", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 10, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 5}, {"id": 3037, "code": "test", "tagLabel": "1-原创 IP 漫剧赛道", "parentTag": 3036, "categoryId": 0, "path": "3036/3037", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 10, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 5}], "userTags": [{"tagId": 5001, "name": "先锋", "icon": "/assets/15bcb4d002b68470.webp", "primaryIcon": "/assets/b40570481582e92f.webp", "desc": "LibTV先锋作者", "verifyLevel": 1}], "score": 0, "socialMediaUrl": "https://www.douyin.com/video/7646713681397117786", "createAt": "2026年06月02日 16:54", "updateAt": "2026年06月02日 22:43", "publishAt": "2026年06月02日 22:35", "playCount": 8, "viewCreationProcessCount": 1, "copyCanvasCount": 0, "shareCount": 0, "snapshotPath": "/data/canvas-snapshots/ce91882273bd443d8b0ecdec4a477226.json.gz", "snapshotSummary": {"nodes": 81, "edges": 154}}, "recommendList": []}